---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title="全部文章" active="articles"><div class="shell collection-page"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THE KNOWLEDGE GARDEN</span><h1>每一篇，都是新的连接<span class="mint-dot">.</span></h1><p>在文字里探索，在实践中理解。让零散的想法，逐渐连成自己的地图。</p><div class="collection-actions"><a class="quiet-link mint" href="/manage/">写作空间 <Icon name="northeast" size={14}/></a><a class="quiet-link" id="collection-source-link" href="/articles/?examples=1">查看示例文章</a></div></div><form id="article-search-form" class="collection-search" action="/articles/"><label class="sr-only" for="article-query">搜索文章全文</label><Icon name="search" /><input id="article-query" type="search" name="q" placeholder="搜索标题、正文或标签…" autocomplete="off" /><span class="search-scope">全文搜索</span></form><div class="filter-panel"><div class="filter-tags" id="article-tags" aria-label="按标签筛选"></div><label class="category-filter">分类<select id="category-filter"><option value="">全部分类</option></select></label></div><div class="list-summary"><span id="result-count" role="status">正在读取已发布文章…</span><span>按发布日期排序 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></span></div><div class="cards-grid" id="article-results"></div><div id="article-empty" class="empty-state" hidden><Icon name="search" size={36} /><h2>还没有找到这片叶子</h2><p>换一个关键词，或放下筛选条件，再探索一次。</p><button class="button button-primary" id="reset-filters">清除搜索与筛选 <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></button><div class="empty-writing-actions" hidden><a class="button button-primary" href="/manage/">开始写作</a><a class="button" href="/manage/?import=1">导入文档</a></div></div><div class="load-more-row"><button class="button" id="article-load-more" hidden>继续探索更多文章 ↓</button></div><p class="collection-disclaimer" id="collection-disclaimer" hidden>当前仅展示明确标注的示例文章，不代表作者真实经历。<a href="/articles/">返回正式内容</a></p><noscript><p class="search-hint">请开启 JavaScript 以读取文档列表和搜索。</p></noscript></div><script>import '../../scripts/collection';</script></Layout>
